  message: "Source-side fix WIP-committed on branch jgstern-agent/fix/inv-naduh-role-files-tier1 (commit 0c9a8b9d98), NOT yet merged. Done: supply_chain.py classify_file routes examples (keeps is_example=True) / documentation / .ipynb notebooks / fuzz-bench to Tier.FIRST_PARTY (were INTERNAL_DEP); cli.py route-promotion promotes generated/derived routes tier 4->1 (was 2). internal_package_roots KEPT at tier 2 (genuine org-internal). REMAINING (resume on the branch): ~27 tests in test_supply_chain.py encode the OLD tier-2 contract and now fail by design — flip role-file tier assertions INTERNAL_DEP->FIRST_PARTY + rename (classes: TestInternalDepDetection example tests, TestDocCClassification, TestNotebookClassification, TestFuzzBenchClassification, TestIsExampleFileAxis, TestIsTestFileAxis::test_fuzz_file_is_not_marked_is_test), KEEPING the legitimate internal_package_roots/enum/workspace-package INTERNAL_DEP assertions; add a route-promotion->tier1 test; full validation + manifest; auto-pr; then close violated->satisfied with the fixture evidence. Route-promotion 2->1 was an in-scope sibling §1 violation (in-repo generated routes are distance-0)."  # f6fe
